{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"tannery","model_identifier":"tannery","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# tannery\n\nTannery: a smelly yard of stretched hides on frames, soaking pits of brown liquor, and a low shed.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 8 columns (160 x 128 units, 4.50 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -76..69, y 0..95, z -50..62 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 78, construction_0 32, construction_33 37, construction_66 47, ruined 19 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- shed: 68 x 96 x 52 centred at x -40, z 32\n- hide frames: 24 x 40 x 2 each (4)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `tannery_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `tannery_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_tannery` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 2.4 | loop | `sign` swings. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-40, 0, -1)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-40, 0, -6)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"shed_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-74.0,0.0,6.0],"to":[-6.0,3.0,58.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,279.0,68.0,282.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[58.0,285.0,110.0,288.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,279.0,68.0,282.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[58.0,285.0,110.0,288.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[58.0,119.0,126.0,171.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[58.0,119.0,126.0,171.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a1aaa5d1-b779-5e22-b04e-d701b33e8543"},{"name":"shed_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-72.0,3.0,8.0],"to":[-8.0,55.0,12.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[126.0,119.0,190.0,171.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[242.0,119.0,246.0,171.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[126.0,119.0,190.0,171.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[242.0,119.0,246.0,171.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,255.0,64.0,259.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,255.0,64.0,259.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"46acc9b8-db25-522b-9030-c9d1ae08b235"},{"name":"shed_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-72.0,3.0,52.0],"to":[-8.0,55.0,56.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[126.0,119.0,190.0,171.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[246.0,119.0,250.0,171.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[126.0,119.0,190.0,171.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[246.0,119.0,250.0,171.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[64.0,255.0,128.0,259.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[64.0,255.0,128.0,259.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ddbbd93e-6b1b-58e0-a14e-5a737c