der":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"71030fac-3434-5ff3-b68a-2d55a26b460d","relative_path":"tannery.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[{"uuid":"ec38b4c8-2f42-5b9d-8c74-f34e835f1504","name":"working","loop":"loop","override":false,"length":2.4,"snapping":24,"selected":false,"anim_time_update":"","blend_weight":"","start_delay":"","loop_delay":"","animators":{"e1ce781d-4728-5c1e-8524-53182d7bee5d":{"name":"sign","type":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"d458ecd9-60ef-5a12-8c4f-2fb4c378c4b6","time":0.0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":10.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"5d68b460-e1bc-5bbe-84ff-ac28d9e77112","time":0.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"bff6f14c-aeec-5a49-a32b-f850f09cc431","time":1.2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-10.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"f9357b79-22e8-58ce-a785-71a10f72a764","time":1.8,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"b522c386-b954-5d6c-bf97-d17e5c809f6d","time":2.4,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"# tannery\n\nTannery: a smelly yard of stretched hides on frames, soaking pits of brown liquor, and a low shed.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 8 columns (160 x 128 units, 4.50 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -76..69, y 0..95, z -50..62 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 78, construction_0 32, construction_33 37, construction_66 47, ruined 19 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- shed: 68 x 96 x 52 centred at x -40, z 32\n- hide frames: 24 x 40 x 2 each (4)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `tannery_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `tannery_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_tannery` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 2.4 | loop | `sign` swings. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-40, 0, -1)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-40, 0, -6)\n"}